# FridgeStock reads no settings at the root of the repository: each package has its own file.
# Copy the one you need next to it as .env (never commit a .env file):
#
#   server/.env.example         -> server/.env          the API: port, database, JWT secret, push, AI keys
#   client/.env.example         -> client/.env          the web app: the API address (VITE_API_URL)
#   client/.env.native.example  -> client/.env.native   the Android and iOS apps: the API address built into them
#
# Every value is optional in development. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md for what production needs.
